notes.notes:
- Added a new level: London Heathrow (LHR, 2 runways, medium difficulty, increased probability of rain and fog);
- Optimized culling (noticeable improved FPS); 
- Changed the controller bindings for Valve Index (Force Grip to Axis Grip);
- Added controller bindings for HTC Cosmos;

This version includes two significant fixes:
- You can grab the airplane for new route defining just by using trigger button;
- The airport surrounding improved;

- Sprint mode can be switched on by pressing controller thumbstick;
- Several graphical improvements;
- Added achievements info messages;
- Added game settings screen;
- 3 major bugfixes;
